scovered the Dark Castle describe it as surrounded by exceptionally unique environments. Strange mutations have affected nearby creatures, and even mysterious Ethreals and Soul Crystals have been found. Everything indicates that the Dark Castle holds hidden secrets within...</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>A new adventure beckons for treasure hunters. Join the Treasure Hunters Guild, journey to the enigmatic Dark Castle, and embark on a fresh treasure-seeking expedition! </i></p>",
